#: udm/handlers/announcement.py:55
msgid "If enabled, the announcement can't be closed and will persist until the time ends (or never)."
msgstr "如果啟用，公告將無法關閉，並會持續顯示直到時間結束 (或永不結束)。"

#: udm/handlers/announcement.py:47
msgid "If enabled, the user will see a \"Confirm\" button and the announcement will persist until it is clicked."
msgstr "如果啟用，使用者會看到一個「確認」按鈕，公告將持續顯示直到該按鈕被按下。"

#: udm/handlers/announcement.py:40
msgid "If one or more groups are selected then the portal announcement will only be visible to logged in users that are in any of the selected groups. If no groups are selected then the portal entry is always visible."
msgstr "如果選取了一個或多個群組，則入口網站公告只會對屬於任一選取群組的已登入使用者顯示。如果未選取任何群組，則入口網站項目永遠顯示。"

#: udm/handlers/entry.py:69
msgid "If one or more groups are selected then the portal entry will only be visible to logged in users that are in any of the selected groups. If no groups are selected then the portal entry is always visible."
msgstr "如果選取了一個或多個群組，則入口網站項目只會對屬於任一選取群組的已登入使用者顯示。如果未選取任何群組，則入口網站項目永遠顯示。"

